title: SunsetPainting
---
<<declare $sunset_painting_interaction_times = 0>>
<<if $sunset_painting_interaction_times==0>>
 It's a painting of the sunset.
 Something about the way the colors interact makes it seem like the sun is almost glowing.
 <<set $sunset_painting_interaction_times = 1>>
<<elseif $sunset_painting_interaction_times==1>>
 You remember when the painting was first installed.
 A town known for its beautiful sunsets, localizing it into a painting.
 You wondered at the time why look at a picture rather than just going outside.
 <<set $sunset_painting_interaction_times = 2>>
<<else>>
 It's a painting of the sunset.
<<endif>>
===
